  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Eco-Leaders: Youth Empowerment Initiative on Environment, Climate and Renewable Energy for Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To promote youth engagement in climate and environment through the &quot;Eco-Leaders: Youth Empowerment Initiative on Environment, Climate and Renewable Energy for Bangladesh&quot;. The project is a transformative program designed to empower and equip 500 young individuals, aged 18 to 35, with the knowledge, skills, and inspiration to become effective advocates and leaders in environmental conservation, climate action, and renewable energy adoption.</narrative>
  </description>
